<title>INDIA: INDIAN MONEY MARKET RATES - Sept 11 (1300 IST).</title>
<headline>INDIAN MONEY MARKET RATES - Sept 11 (1300 IST).</headline>
<text>
<p>Indicative market rates</p>
<p>* Call money:(O/N/)			 6.00-6.50 pct</p>
<p>* Commercial paper: P1+		  13.00-13.50 pct</p>
<p>* Commercial paper: P1		   13.50-15.50 pct</p>
<p>* Certificate of deposit: 90 day     10.00-13.00 pct</p>
<p>* Treasury bills:</p>
<p>  91  day t-bill			   10.00-10.20 pct</p>
<p>  364 day t-bill			   12.80-13.00 pct</p>
